# Task 3 MuJoCo large visual assets — not tracked in git; download separately.
# Listed one by one on purpose: a glob over *.obj/*.png would also swallow the
# small collision STLs, source USD/GLB, and textures that ARE tracked. These 21
# files are every scene-referenced asset above the 2 MB pre-commit limit (~173 MB
# raw). See task3_mujoco/README.md and task3_mujoco/scripts/download_large_assets.sh
